POST http://localhost:4321/api/generate/checklist
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:4321

{}

### 2.5 / 2.6 — z auth, streaming + X-Trip-Id header
# Uzupełnij Cookie: sb-<project>-auth-token=<token> po zalogowaniu
POST http://localhost:4321/api/generate/checklist
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:4321
Cookie: sb-rhfjnksirzyvpzcfnklz-auth-token=base64-

{
  "accommodation_type": "tent",
  "riding_philosophy": "fast_and_light",
  "region": "Tatry",
  "start_date": "2026-08-01",
  "trip_duration_days": 3,
  "title": "Test S-01"
}

